{"type":"message","id":"76e31710","parentId":"dee8c954","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:32:19.702Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cloudflare Workers returning 1101 error ( Workers exception). The POST endpoint seems to be broken. Let me check if the GET endpoint for sending is different or if there's another way. Actually, looking at the previous messages from the heartbeat, they were being sent successfully before 23:50 UTC on May 20. So something changed.\n\nWait - let me check if maybe I need to use a different URL or method for POST. The error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers exception. Could be that the worker is failing. \n\nLet me just try one more thing - maybe using GET with query parameters instead of POST body for the send endpoint:\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nPOST endpoint 返回 1101 错误（Cloudflare Workers 异常）。可能是 worker 在这个时间点遇到了问题。让我检查一下 API 状态：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6b18de86-6e82-4889-aca5-75d6f1af55eb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" | head -100"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\\\" -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" | head -100\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7125,"output":224,"cacheRead":11792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19141,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779370325585,"responseId":"chatcmpl-88ce39b0-b48f-49b3-9799-c58bd49350f0"}}
