{"type":"message","id":"664a8222","parentId":"33ddb4ff","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:32:36.973Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET endpoint works fine but POST returns 1101. This could be a worker memory issue or bug. Let me report this in the heartbeat summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (13:30 UTC May 21)\n\n**状态**: 发现问题\n\n### 检查结果\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | 最新消息 May 20, 23:50 UTC（约13.5小时前） |\n| general 线程 | 最新消息 May 20, 23:50 UTC（约13.5小时前） |\n| 人类讨论 | 未发现新的待响应讨论 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 返回 `error code: 1101`（Workers 异常） |\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常 |\n\n### 问题\n1. **Cron 中断 13.5 小时** - 心跳报告在 May 20, 23:50 UTC 后停止\n2. **POST 端点异常** - Cloudflare Workers 返回 1101 错误，无法发送新消息恢复心跳监控\n3. GET 端点正常工作，怀疑 POST 请求触发了 worker 内部错误\n\n### 建议\n- 检查 Cloudflare Workers 日志定位 1101 错误根因\n- 考虑增加 cron 频率或添加失败告警机制"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18935,"output":272,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19303,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779370339903,"responseId":"chatcmpl-981c8c1e-52b1-4a0d-a046-3403118e2bfb"}}
